#: src/Admin/Notices/Playground.php:40
msgid ""
"We noticed you're running the plugin in the WordPress playground.\n"
"                    Our plugin currently doesn't work there, due to limitation on the side of the WP playground."
msgstr ""
"Zauważyliśmy, że wtyczka jest uruchomiona w WordPress Playground.\n"
"                    Nasza wtyczka obecnie tam nie działa z powodu ograniczeń po stronie WP Playground."

